  "answer_text": "Here is an overview of **wakehealth.edu** \u2014 the website for **Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist**:\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udfe5 Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist\n\nAtrium Health Wake Forest Baptist is a nationally recognized, fully integrated academic medical center and health system located in **Winston-Salem, North Carolina**.\n\n### \ud83d\udd11 Key Components\n\nThe organization's two main components are:\n1. **An integrated clinical system** \u2014 anchored by Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist Medical Center, an **885-bed tertiary-care hospital** in Winston-Salem \u2014 that includes Brenner Children's Hospital, five community hospitals, more than 300 primary and specialty care locations, and more than 2,700 physicians.\n2. **Wake Forest University School of Medicine** \u2014 a recognized leader in experiential medical education and groundbreaking research.\n\n### \ud83e\udd1d Part of Advocate Health\n\nAtrium Health Wake Forest Baptist is part of **Advocate Health**, the third-largest nonprofit health system in the United States. Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist employs more than **20,000 teammates**, part of Advocate Health's 150,000 teammates.\n\n### \ud83d\udd2c Research & Innovation\n\nWake Forest University School of Medicine is a recognized leader in experiential medical education and groundbreaking research, including **Wake Forest Innovations**, which is advancing new medical technologies and biomedical discoveries.\n\n### \ud83c\udfc6 Specialty Services\n\nSpecialty services include Preventive Care, Specialized Care, Children's Hospital, Comprehensive Cancer Center, Digestive Health Center, Heart Center, Neurosciences, Orthopaedics, Transplantation, a **Level I Trauma Center**, and Urology.\n\n### \ud83d\udc9b Community Impact\n\nAtrium Health Wake Forest Baptist provided a record-setting **$611.2 million in community benefits** during the 2021 fiscal year, which includes unreimbursed care, charity care, education and research, and community health improvement.\n\n---\n\nYou can visit their official website at **[wakehealth.edu](https://www.wakehealth.edu)** for more information on patient care, research, education, and careers. Is there something specific about Wake Forest Baptist you'd like to know more about?",
